      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Expressway at 50 mph with three lanes and only a narrow painted lane; no reasonable interested rider should use it.</data>
      <data key="d33">bike_lane_blocked,expressway,high_speed_traffic</data>
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">2.333</data>
      <data key="d36">0.1</data>
      <data key="d37">Wide expressway with a few trees and hedges along the edges; mostly pavement and walls, little canopy over the road.</data>
    </edge>
