      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Trunk link ramp with unmapped speed and no visible bike lane; cars cross a freeway-style merge, so rate it very stressful.</data>
      <data key="d33">freeway_ramp_crossing,no_bike_lane</data>
      <data key="d34">low</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Large trees line the corner and hedge planting, but it is a wide intersection dominated by pavement and signals.</data>
    </edge>
