      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet residential street with 25 mph limit, light traffic, good pavement and clear sight lines; suitable for all riders.</data>
      <data key="d33" />
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">3.667</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Tall pines and mature trees frame a quiet residential lane, though the sky stays mostly open.</data>
    </edge>
