      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted bike lane beside a wide, multi-lane arterial at 35 mph; wide lane and good pavement help.</data>
      <data key="d33">high_speed_traffic</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.0</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Large street trees and lawns line the road, but the wide arterial and parking lots limit the natural feel.</data>
