      <data key="d29">0</data>
      <data key="d30">0.7</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted bike lane on a two-lane residential street with clear sight lines and good pavement; speed limit unmapped.</data>
      <data key="d33" />
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.667</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Tall mature trees line the left side and a lawn strip borders the street, though the far crossing is open pavement.</data>
    </edge>
