      <data key="d30">0.7</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet residential road with no bike lane, but low speeds and light traffic make riding manageable.</data>
      <data key="d33">no_bike_lane</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">2.778</data>
      <data key="d36">0.1</data>
      <data key="d37">Some trees and low shrubs at the corner, but the road is open with little canopy overhead and a heavy glare.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="1313766356" target="7748131843" id="0">
