      <data key="d30">0.6</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">No bike lane, but a wide, smooth, clear approach with few cars and low expected speeds; driveways add some conflict.</data>
      <data key="d33">frequent_driveways</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">2.333</data>
      <data key="d36">0.1</data>
      <data key="d37">Mostly pavement and a white office building; a few scattered trees and small shrubs, little canopy over the road.</data>
    </edge>
