      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted bike lane on a 40 mph road with several through lanes; narrow buffer from fast traffic.</data>
      <data key="d33">frequent_driveways,high_speed_traffic</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Mature street trees line one side and frame the road, but canopy over the roadway is only partial and the view is wide and built-up.</data>
