      <data key="d30">0.8</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet 25 mph residential street with light traffic; parked cars and driveways are the main concerns.</data>
      <data key="d33">door_zone</data>
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Leafy street trees and shrubs on both sides, but canopy over the road is only partial and parked cars block some view.</data>
    </edge>
