      <data key="d28">1346.6564084082008</data>
      <data key="d29">0</data>
      <data key="d30">0.8</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet 25 mph street with no bike lane, good pavement and clear sightlines; driveways add some conflict.</data>
      <data key="d33">frequent_driveways</data>
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">2.333</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">A large tree and planted beds line the corner, but the street is mostly pavement beside a strip mall.</data>
    </edge>
