      <data key="d29">0</data>
      <data key="d30">0.8</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet 25 mph street with a painted bike lane and clear sight lines; the curb-side view shows a painted lane, not the mapped separated path.</data>
      <data key="d33" />
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Mature street trees and planting on the left, but the wide street and bare right side keep canopy partial.</data>
    </edge>
