      <data key="d29">0</data>
      <data key="d30">0.8</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet one-way residential street with good pavement and clear sight lines, though no bike lane is mapped.</data>
      <data key="d33">no_bike_lane</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.667</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Tree-lined residential street with mature trees and planted front yards, though the canopy over the road is only partial.</data>
    </edge>
