      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet residential street with no bike lane, low traffic and clear sight lines; comfortable for most riders.</data>
      <data key="d33" />
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Residential street with street trees on the left and mature trees beyond; canopy over the road is only partial.</data>
    </edge>
