      <data key="d29">0</data>
      <data key="d30">0.8</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet 25 mph residential street with clear sight lines and good pavement; parked cars add some door risk.</data>
      <data key="d33">door_zone</data>
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Residential street with large street trees on one side and a few on the other, but canopy over the road is only partial.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="2620426740" target="7136073508" id="0">
      <data key="d12">377584893</data>
      <data key="d15">unclassified</data>
      <data key="d16">2</data>
      <data key="d17">25 mph</data>
      <data key="d18">Cabot Avenue</data>
