      <data key="d29">0</data>
      <data key="d30">0.6</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet 25 mph street with parked cars and driveways, no bike lane, but otherwise manageable for careful riders.</data>
      <data key="d33">door_zone,frequent_driveways</data>
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">2.778</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Leafy street trees and some planting strips, but parked cars and pavement dominate and canopy over the road is thin.</data>
    </edge>
