      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted bike lane on a 35 mph four-lane street, but parked cars and many driveways reduce comfort.</data>
      <data key="d33">door_zone,frequent_driveways</data>
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">2.333</data>
      <data key="d36">0.1</data>
      <data key="d37">Wide commercial arterial with parking lots and a bank; only a few young trees and palms along the edges.</data>
