      <data key="d30">0.6</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted bike lane on a 25 mph street, but parked cars and many driveways add door and turning conflicts.</data>
      <data key="d33">door_zone,frequent_driveways</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Tall cypress and scattered street trees line one side; sparse canopy over the road, with bare trees in March.</data>
    </edge>
