      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Five-lane arterial at 35 mph with cracked pavement; a painted bike lane is mapped but its curb edge is out of view.</data>
      <data key="d33">high_speed_traffic,poor_pavement</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Street trees line one side and a shrub-planted strip runs along the curb, but canopy over the road is only partial and buildings and parking dominate.</data>
    </edge>
