      <data key="d29">0</data>
      <data key="d30">0.8</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet residential street with clear sight lines and good pavement, though no bike lane and several driveways.</data>
      <data key="d33">frequent_driveways</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.667</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Residential street with mature trees and lush hedges on both sides, though the canopy over the road has gaps.</data>
    </edge>
