      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Three-lane one-way arterial at 40 mph; mapped bike lane is present but the curb-side view is limited.</data>
      <data key="d33">high_speed_traffic</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">1.889</data>
      <data key="d36">0.1</data>
      <data key="d37">Wide commercial arterial with parking lots and a few scattered trees; little canopy or planting visible.</data>
