      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted buffered bike lane on a 35 mph arterial with parked cars and good pavement; moderate stress.</data>
      <data key="d33">door_zone,high_speed_traffic</data>
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Mature street trees and planted strips soften this arterial, but canopy over the road is only partial and buildings and parking dominate.</data>
