      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted bike lane on a busy three-lane one-way arterial at 35 mph; passing traffic is close but the lane is clear.</data>
      <data key="d33">high_speed_traffic</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Stevens Creek Boulevard has street trees and planting strips, but commercial buildings and pavement dominate and canopy over the road is partial.</data>
