      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet 30 mph road with sharrows only; manageable for confident riders, with no painted bike lane.</data>
      <data key="d33">sharrows_only</data>
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Street trees and planting strips line the road, but canopy over the road is only partial and buildings and pavement dominate.</data>
    </edge>
