      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Wide, smooth, quiet-looking road with clear sight lines, but no bike lane and only a bike route marking.</data>
      <data key="d33">sharrows_only</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">2.778</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Corporate campus street with trees and planting strips on both sides, but little canopy over the road.</data>
    </edge>
