      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet 25 mph residential street with clear sightlines; parked cars create door-zone risk and pavement is cracked.</data>
      <data key="d33">door_zone,poor_pavement</data>
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">3.667</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Tree-lined residential street with mature trees and flowering plantings, though canopy has gaps over the road.</data>
    </edge>
