      <data key="d30">0.4</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Mapped bike lane on a 40 mph four-lane road with many driveways; the lane edge is not clearly visible in photos.</data>
      <data key="d33">frequent_driveways,high_speed_traffic</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Tall pines line one side and some landscaping fronts the shops, but the wide arterial has little canopy over the road.</data>
    </edge>
