      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">One-way tertiary link with no bike lane and a right-turn-only lane; slow traffic keeps it manageable.</data>
      <data key="d33">no_bike_lane,right_turn_slip_lane</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">2.333</data>
      <data key="d36">0.1</data>
      <data key="d37">Wide commercial intersection with a few young trees and a small lawn island; mostly pavement and parking lots.</data>
