      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted lane on a 40 mph arterial with many driveways and a squeezed lane beside right-turn traffic.</data>
      <data key="d33">bike_lane_between_turn_lanes,frequent_driveways,high_speed_traffic</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">2.333</data>
      <data key="d36">0.1</data>
      <data key="d37">Wide arterial with a few young trees and shrubs in the median; mostly pavement, buildings and parking.</data>
    </edge>
