      <data key="d30">0.9</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet 25 mph residential street with wide, smooth pavement and clear sight lines; easy riding.</data>
      <data key="d33" />
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Residential street with street trees on the left and a hedge on the right, but canopy over the road is only partial.</data>
    </edge>
