      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">2.778</data>
      <data key="d36">0.1</data>
      <data key="d37">Sparse young trees and some shrubs line the street; a wooded hillside lies beyond the white wall, but little canopy covers the road.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="4913172939" target="65507560" id="0">
      <data key="d12">8939989</data>
      <data key="d15">residential</data>
      <data key="d18">Doyle Road</data>
      <data key="d20">asphalt</data>
      <data key="d19">False</data>
      <data key="d21">True</data>
      <data key="d22">184.3779336076933</data>
      <data key="d26">LINESTRING (-121.9954222 37.3145531, -121.9953895 37.3148718, -121.9953372 37.3151416, -121.9952929 37.3153742, -121.9952461 37.3154511, -121.9951691 37.3154895, -121.9947678 37.3155204, -121.994689 37.3155689, -121.9946518 37.3156331, -121.9946491 37.315713, -121.9946487 37.3157241, -121.9946465 37.3158349)</data>
      <data key="d27">47.57992025637091</data>
      <data key="d28">58.45060176372892</data>
      <data key="d29">0</data>
      <data key="d30">0.7</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet-looking road with no bike lane, narrow edge space and unknown speed; manageable for careful riders.</data>
      <data key="d33">no_bike_lane</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">2.778</data>
      <data key="d36">0.1</data>
      <data key="d37">Shrubs and a few trees line one side, but the road has no canopy and a fenced open area sits beside it.</data>
    </edge>
