      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet 25 mph local road with clear sightlines and good pavement; no bike lane, but low traffic stress.</data>
      <data key="d33" />
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">2.778</data>
      <data key="d36">0.1</data>
      <data key="d37">Open paved lot with a few scattered trees and a park-like area beyond, but little canopy over the road.</data>
    </edge>
