      <data key="d21">True</data>
      <data key="d22">45.1193350528954</data>
      <data key="d24">lane</data>
      <data key="d26">LINESTRING (-122.050535 37.3310258, -122.050503 37.3308774, -122.0505018 37.3306222)</data>
      <data key="d41">SEPARATED BIKEWAY</data>
      <data key="d42">IV</data>
      <data key="d27">194.77340641120884</data>
      <data key="d28">683.2840202624722</data>
      <data key="d29">0</data>
      <data key="d30">0.7</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted bike lanes on a quiet tertiary street with few driveways; parked cars create some door-zone risk.</data>
      <data key="d33">door_zone</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Tall street trees on one side and some landscaping, but canopy over the road is only partial and planting is modest.</data>
    </edge>
