      <data key="d30">0.9</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Mapped as a separated bikeway on a residential street; the road surface looks good and sight lines are clear.</data>
      <data key="d33" />
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">2.778</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Scattered mature trees and some shrubs line a walkway, but the street itself is mostly pavement with little canopy overhead.</data>
    </edge>
