      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet residential park-side street with clear sight lines and good pavement; no bike lane but low traffic stress.</data>
      <data key="d33">no_bike_lane</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">4.111</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Large redwood and mature trees border a grassy park edge with lush planting along the residential street.</data>
    </edge>
