      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted bike lane on a 25 mph two-lane road, with some parked cars and narrow edge space making it a bit stressful.</data>
      <data key="d33">door_zone</data>
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">2.778</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Residential-to-commercial street with scattered mature trees and a few planting strips, but little canopy over the road.</data>
    </edge>
