      <data key="d30">0.7</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Mapped bike lane on a 35 mph road with one lane each way; cracked pavement and an unclear curb-side edge lower the score.</data>
      <data key="d33">poor_pavement</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.667</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Tall mature trees line both sides with partial canopy, though the road is wide and the gated entry is hardscaped.</data>
    </edge>
