      <data key="d29">0</data>
      <data key="d30">0.6</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet residential street at 30 mph with parked RVs and cars; sharrows only, so riders share the lane with door risk.</data>
      <data key="d33">door_zone,sharrows_only</data>
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">2.778</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Large conifers and a few leafy trees on the left soften the view, but parked RVs and cars dominate the right side.</data>
    </edge>
