      <data key="d30">0.6</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted bike lane on a 30 mph road with cracked pavement and narrow edge space; generally comfortable for a careful rider.</data>
      <data key="d33">poor_pavement</data>
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">3.444</data>
      <data key="d36">0.25</data>
      <data key="d37">Tree-lined residential street with mature trees and hedges on both sides, though canopy over the road has gaps.</data>
    </edge>
