      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Narrow, quiet residential lane with good pavement, but no bike lane and some tree-lined blind curves.</data>
      <data key="d33">no_bike_lane</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">4.556</data>
      <data key="d36">0.7</data>
      <data key="d37">Large oaks form a closed canopy over a narrow hillside lane, with dense understory and wooded slopes all around.</data>
