      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">4.556</data>
      <data key="d36">0.7</data>
      <data key="d37">Dense mature oaks form a closed canopy over a hillside lane, with lush roadside vegetation and no buildings dominating the view.</data>
