      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted bike lane on a moderately busy road with clear sight lines and good pavement; city lists it as separated but photos show painted lane.</data>
      <data key="d33">no_bike_lane</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">2.778</data>
      <data key="d36">0.1</data>
      <data key="d37">Wide road with planted medians and some tall pines, but little canopy over the roadway; hills are visible beyond.</data>
    </edge>
