      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Red-painted separated bikeway on a quiet one-way street with good pavement and clear sight lines.</data>
      <data key="d33" />
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Tall street trees and shrub planting line the road, but canopy over the road is only partial and buildings dominate.</data>
