      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Green-painted separated bikeway on a 25 mph road with few driveways and clear sight lines.</data>
      <data key="d33" />
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Tall conifers and ornamental shrubs line the road, but the wide crossing and pavement keep it fairly hardscaped.</data>
