      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Separated bikeway on a 25 mph road with few driveways, clear sight lines and good pavement.</data>
      <data key="d33" />
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Tall conifers line one side and some planting frames the road, but the crossing is mostly pavement and signals.</data>
