      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet residential street with wide lanes, clear sight lines and good pavement; no bike lane but low traffic.</data>
      <data key="d33" />
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Street trees line both sides with partial canopy, but there is a tiled-roof complex and parked cars in view.</data>
