      <data key="d30">0.4</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted lane on a busy three-lane one-way arterial with many driveways; workable but stressful for most riders.</data>
      <data key="d33">frequent_driveways,high_speed_traffic</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">2.778</data>
      <data key="d36">0.1</data>
      <data key="d37">Wide suburban arterial with planted strips and some trees, but little canopy over the road and mostly pavement and buildings.</data>
    </edge>
