      <data key="d30">0.8</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet residential street with no bike lane, parked cars and good pavement; low traffic makes it comfortable.</data>
      <data key="d33">door_zone,frequent_driveways,no_bike_lane</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.25</data>
      <data key="d37">Residential street with scattered trees and palms on one side, but canopy over the road is only partial.</data>
    </edge>
