      <data key="d28">640.4312731680329</data>
      <data key="d29">0</data>
      <data key="d30">0.8</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet rural-residential road at 30 mph with clear sight lines and good pavement, though there is no bike lane.</data>
      <data key="d33">sharrows_only</data>
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">4.111</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Mature oaks and conifers line a rural canyon road with hillside views, though canopy over the road is only partial.</data>
    </edge>
