      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted bike lane on a three-lane street with good pavement and clear sight lines; moderate traffic.</data>
      <data key="d33">no_median_refuge</data>
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">2.778</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Commercial strip with scattered street trees and some planting, but little canopy over the road and mostly pavement.</data>
    </edge>
