      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted bike lane on a two-lane street with good pavement, though parked cars add door-zone risk.</data>
      <data key="d33">door_zone</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">2.333</data>
      <data key="d36">0.1</data>
      <data key="d37">Wide intersection with pavement and signals; only a few trees and shrubs along the curb, mostly hardscape.</data>
