      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Quiet residential hill road with no bike lane; narrow edges and partly blocked sight lines on curves.</data>
      <data key="d33">no_bike_lane</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">3.667</data>
      <data key="d36">0.3</data>
      <data key="d37">Hillside residential road with mature trees and shrubs on both sides, but canopy over the road is only partial.</data>
