      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Narrow, winding, tree-lined residential road with light traffic and smooth pavement; no bike lane but low stress.</data>
      <data key="d33">no_bike_lane</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">5.0</data>
      <data key="d36">0.7</data>
      <data key="d37">Narrow road tunnels under a dense canopy of mature trees, with leafy understory and wooded hillside beside it.</data>
    </edge>
