      <data key="d20">paved</data>
      <data key="d26">LINESTRING (-122.0496774 37.3170479, -122.0497086 37.3169822, -122.0497558 37.3169003, -122.0498146 37.3168154, -122.0498851 37.316729)</data>
      <data key="d41">SEPARATED BIKEWAY</data>
      <data key="d42">IV</data>
      <data key="d27">287.81238170670696</data>
      <data key="d28">76.59251542065356</data>
      <data key="d29">0</data>
      <data key="d30">0.9</data>
      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Separated bikeway alongside a wide, well-kept, low-traffic road with clear sight lines and few driveways.</data>
      <data key="d33" />
      <data key="d34">high</data>
      <data key="d35">3.222</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Tall trees and landscaped planting line the road, but canopy over the roadway is only partial.</data>
    </edge>
