      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Mapped buffered bike lane on 35 mph road; many driveways and parked cars, though pavement and sight lines are good.</data>
      <data key="d33">frequent_driveways</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">2.778</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Suburban arterial with street trees and a few planted strips, but little canopy over the road and mostly pavement and parking.</data>
