      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Five-lane 35 mph arterial with parked cars and many driveways; bike lane narrow and partly blocked.</data>
      <data key="d33">bike_lane_blocked,door_zone,frequent_driveways,high_speed_traffic</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">2.333</data>
      <data key="d36">0.1</data>
      <data key="d37">Wide road with young street trees and some planting strips, but mostly pavement, parking and commercial buildings in view.</data>
    </edge>
