      <data key="d31">photo</data>
      <data key="d32">Painted buffered bike lane on a 40 mph street, with fairly clear sight lines and good pavement.</data>
      <data key="d33">high_speed_traffic</data>
      <data key="d34">medium</data>
      <data key="d35">2.778</data>
      <data key="d36">0.2</data>
      <data key="d37">Wide suburban arterial with scattered mature trees and some planting, but mostly pavement and crosswalks in view.</data>
    </edge>
